msgid ""
"Four empires head face-to-face, surrounded by two large seas. Along with "
"mountains acting like natural walls, which cannot be crossed at all. However, "
"there is one land bridge that connects the large seas, giving the empires a "
"solution, and the only solution to conquer the whole area."
msgstr ""
"Fyra imperier står öga mot öga, omgivna av två stora hav. Berg fungerar som "
"naturliga murar som inte går att passera. Det finns dock en landbrygga som "
"förbinder haven. Den ger imperierna en, och den enda, möjlighet att erövra "
"hela området."
